{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Combat｜近战判定流程\n结构见 [[GGYGO_结构_Combat.canvas|结构图]]；伤害后续见 [[GGYGO_流程_伤害结算.canvas]]。\nCombo/Boss 已接 Owned。Gate79 编译成功，7烟5 Success/2 Fail；四RuntimeHit行为PASS，三条生产Error保留。完整Boss命中、正式资产/Legacy BP迁移与联机未验，见 [[Combat/结构]]。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1710,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "open",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. 原 Combo/Boss Montage Event → Owned 开窗。\nCombo 先 ReleaseTraceWindow(Original) 退原段资源。\nBoss QueryOwnedTraceWindow：Active 重复 Begin 保去重，Inactive 才释放重开。\nTryOpenOwnedTraceWindow(Socket/Radius, 空Expected → Window) → SubscribeWindowHit(Window, Callback → token)。\n回调捕/核 Original、原 Task/Trace、窗口；失败只退自身原资源。\nLegacy 保留兼容，不接管 Owned。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 392,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "baseline",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. 窗口首帧只记录武器两端位置，不生成从旧动画到新动画的虚假扫掠。\n\n调用：MeleeTrace::PerformTrace 首次仅记录 Mesh::GetSocketLocation 两端，避免跨窗口虚假命中。",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 392,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "sweep",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. PerformTrace 按长度/半径确定分段数，逐点 SweepMultiByChannel。\n查询请求 PhysicalMaterial；需求超过 MaxTraceSegments 时关闭并告警。\n按帧间直线近似；大角度旋转仍有误差。",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 392,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "dedupe",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4. 原窗内 HitActorsThisWindow 去重。\nOwned 快照订阅 → callback(OriginalWindow, Actor, Hit)。\n每次外调前核原窗/token，外调后复核；消费者另核自己的原 Activation/来源。\nB 回调关 B 开 C → 停旧分发/扫掠/回写；C 首 Tick 自建基线。\nLegacy 仅广播 OnMeleeHit；Combo/Boss 走 Owned。",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 392,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "ge",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5. Combo/Boss 核原身份、Trace/窗口及权威；同一 HitResult → BuildHitEffectPayload。\nCombo 显式无GE可Cue；Boss须GE/有效必需Spec。伤害由GAS结算。\nCombo 必需 GE/Builder 故障 → RequestAbilityEnd(Original, true, true)。\nBoss 构造失败只拒绝该 hit；有效载荷的 GE 免疫/应用拒绝不吞碰撞 Cue。\n有限验证见 [[Combat/结构]]。",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 918,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "close",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "6. HitWindowEnd/换段/原终止 → GA 清自己的原窗。\nCombo ReleaseTraceWindow；Boss CloseOriginalTraceWindow。\n先脱成员 → UnsubscribeWindowHit(原token) → CloseOwnedTraceWindow(原H)。\nCleanupAbilityResourcesForTermination(Context) 匹配原批次；旧H不关后继。\n组件 Deactivate/OnUnregister/EndPlay/内部失败 → 私有 CloseCurrentTraceWindow。\nCombat 停 Tick/清基线/去重；GA 仍清任务/位移/表现资源。\nLegacy End 仅兼容；独立 EndPlay 动态未验。",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 972,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "1"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "fromNode": "open",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "baseline",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Owned 成功取得原窗口"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2",
      "fromNode": "baseline",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "sweep",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "基线有效"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "fromNode": "sweep",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "dedupe",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "获得命中候选"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4",
      "fromNode": "dedupe",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "ge",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "原窗口/token → Combo/Boss 命中核验"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5",
      "fromNode": "ge",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "close",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "窗口结束／原GA终止 → 清原资源"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6",
      "fromNode": "dedupe",
      "fromSide": "left",
      "toNode": "sweep",
      "toSide": "right",
      "label": "原窗口仍活动才继续；失效退出"
    }
  ]
}
